acy of <i>R-Type Dimensions</i> and <i>R-Type Dimensions EX</i>, <i>Dimensions III</i> has been completely re-envisioned with cutting-edge visuals and sounds, expanded gameplay modes, and a range of new features designed to deliver the most definitive modern edition of R-Type’s classic era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165620/extras/a9e4344d5b02a25ebf863593e74a94c3.avif?t=1783333639\" width=1113 height=159 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully remastered experience with completely reconstructed assets - Both graphics and music switchable on the click of a button!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165620/extras/a7a5cbe1cf29cc1d3a5441e9f3f86fe9.poster.avif?t=1783333639\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165620/extras/a7a5cbe1cf29cc1d3a5441e9f3f86fe9.webm?t=1783333639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165620/extras/a7a5cbe1cf29cc1d3a5441e9f3f86fe9.mp4?t=1783333639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op, enhanced with new scoring and survival mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165620/extras/5b0c6e4429f8bfae86e54461a11b744b.avif?t=1783333639\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable controls and quality-of-life features in the settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb